        "skill2": "在小范围内生成一个持续{Duration}秒的魔力核心，每隔{Tick}秒将{Range}范围内的敌人拉向中心，并造成<#a974ffff>{Damage}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}%法术强度<>点<#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>。",
        "ult": "魔剑士爆发魔力，在<#ffb900ff>{Time}秒<>内，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:range_0><#ff86c2ff>攻击距离增加{Range}<>，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>攻击速度增加{AttackSpeed}%<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>法术强度的{AttackSpeedCoef}%<>，且每次普通攻击都会触发一技能。"
      },
      "monk": {
        "name": "僧侣",
        "skill": "为周围{Range}范围内的友方英雄<#6aff55ff>恢复{Value}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}%法术强度<>点<#6aff55ff>生命值<>。若仅治疗自身，则恢复量提升为<#6aff55ff>{SingleValue}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}%法术强度<>。",
        "skill2": "降下如来神掌惩戒敌人，对{Range}范围内的敌人造成<#a974ffff>{Damage}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}%法术强度<>点<#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>，并使其<#ef5350ff>眩晕{Time}秒<>。",
        "ult": "为周围{Range}范围内的己方英雄施加<#e8d44dff>{Shield}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}%法术强度<>点<#e8d44dff>护盾<>。获得护盾的己方英雄<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移动速度增加{MoveSpeed}%<>。"
