        "skill": "为一名友方英雄和自身注射药剂，在<#ffb900ff>{Duration}秒<>内令<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>攻击速度增加{AttackSpeed}%<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>法术强度的{AttackSpeedCoef}%<>，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移动速度增加{MoveSpeed}%<>。",
