        "ult": "对一名己方英雄注射禁忌秘药，使其当前生命值减少{HpReduceRatio}%。作为交换，该英雄在{Duration}秒内生命值不会低于1，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻击力增加{Attack}<>，且<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>攻击速度增加{AttackSpeed}%<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>法术强度的{AttackSpeedCoef}%<>，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移动速度增加{MoveSpeed}%<>。"
