        "skill2": "跳跃一小段距离，而后立在棍上，{Time}秒内进入无法选中状态，随后挥动棍子，对周围{Range}范围内所有敌人造成<#ff9028ff>{Damage}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}%攻击力<>点<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。",
        "ult": "挥起棍棒跃向{Range}范围内的指定敌人，造成<#ff9028ff>{Damage}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}%攻击力<>点<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>，并将目标<#ef5350ff>击飞{Time}秒<>。"
      },
      "spirit_caller": {
        "name": "精灵使",
        "skill": "召唤一个小精灵伴随己方英雄，在<#ffb900ff>{Duration}秒<>内，小精灵为伴随者恢复<#6aff55ff>{Heal}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{HealRatio}%法术强度<>点<#6aff55ff>生命值<>，并使其<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移动速度增加{SpeedUp}%<>。",
        "skill2": "召唤一个小精灵附身敌人，在<#ffb900ff>{Duration}秒<>内，令其<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>护甲减少{DefDown}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{DefCoef}%法术强度<>点，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:magic resistance_0><#88ccffff>魔法抗性减少{MrDown}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{MrCoef}%法术强度<>点，并使其<#ef5350ff>减速{Slow}%<>。",
        "ult": "引爆现存的小精灵。伴随己方的小精灵提供<#e8d44dff>{Shield}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{ShieldCoef}%法术强度<>点<#e8d44dff>护盾<>和<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>{AttackSpeed}%攻击速度<>。附身敌方的小精灵造成<#a974ffff>{Damage}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{DamageCoef}%法术强度<>点<#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>与<#ef5350ff>{StunTime}秒眩晕<>。"
      },
      "whip_master": {
