        "skill": "鞭击敌人，造成<#ff9028ff>{Damage}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}%攻击力<>点<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>敌方当前生命值{HpRatio}%<>的额外伤害。",
        "skill2": "扇形挥鞭，对范围内的敌人造成<#ff9028ff>{Damage}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}%攻击力<>点<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>并将其击退。",
        "ult": "鞭笞<#ffb900ff>{Duration}秒<>，连续沿直线随机向敌人打出长距离鞭击，每一击造成<#ff9028ff>{Damage}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}%攻击力<>点<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>，并施加<#ef5350ff>流血<>效果。"
      },
      "enchanter": {
