        "skill": "每次受到敵方英雄攻擊時，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>最大生命值<>增加{Value}。",
        "skill2": "用巨棍敲擊一個敵人，眩暈其<#ef5350ff>{Time}秒<>並造成<#ff9028ff>{Damage}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}%攻擊力<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>{HpCoef}%最大生命值<>點<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>。",
        "ult": "身體巨大化，持續{Time}秒。期間，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>最大生命值增加{Buff}%<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>最大生命值的{HpCoef}%<>。"
      },
      "plague_doctor": {
