        "skill": "為一名友方英雄和自身注射藥劑，在<#ffb900ff>{Duration}秒<>內令<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>攻擊速度增加{AttackSpeed}%<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>法術強度的{AttackSpeedCoef}%<>，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移動速度增加{MoveSpeed}%<>。",
        "skill2": "為一名己方英雄舉行儀式，使其在<#ffb900ff>{Duration}秒<>內<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:range_0><#ff86c2ff>攻擊距離增加{Range}<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>法術強度的{RangeCoef}%<>，並使其攻擊附帶突進效果。",
        "ult": "對一名己方英雄注射禁忌祕藥，使其目前生命值減少{HpReduceRatio}%。作為交換，該單位在{Duration}秒內生命值不會低於1，且<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻擊力增加{Attack}<>,<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>攻擊速度增加{AttackSpeed}%<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>法術強度的{AttackSpeedCoef}%<>，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移動速度增加{MoveSpeed}%<>。"
