        "skill2": "{Time}kekona no <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>māmā neʻe {Speed}% <> hoʻouka {BurnTime}kekona no <#ff9028ff>{BurnDamage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>o ka pōʻino hoʻouka {BurnCoef}%<> e like me pōʻino hou.",
        "ult": "{Time}kekona no <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>māmā neʻe {Speed}%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>o ka pōʻino hoʻouka {SpeedCoef}%<>, kūlana. kūlana lumi <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>māmā neʻe {Buff}%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>o ka pōʻino hoʻouka {SpeedCoef}%<> piʻi."
