        "skill2": ". pōʻino. mākau i ka ʻenemi e lele wiki ana <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>o ka mana mākau {Coef}%<> e like me <#a974ffff>pōʻino kilokilo<> pōʻino <#6aff55ff>{Lifesteal}% ola hoʻōla<>.",
        "ult": "lumi {Count}mea. <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>o ka mana mākau {Coef}%<> e like me <#a974ffff>pōʻino kilokilo<> ka ʻenemi kikeke aku."
      },
      "voodoo_shaman": {
        "name": "Inoa",
        "skill": "e pana ana <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>o ka mana mākau {Coef}%<> e like me <#a974ffff>pōʻino kilokilo<>, <#ef5350ff>{Time}kekona no {Slow}% hoʻolohi<> <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>māmā hoʻouka {AtkSpd}%<> <#ffb900ff>{AtkSpdTime}kekona<> no.",
        "skill2": "<#ffb900ff>{Time}kekona<> no, <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>o ka mana mākau {Coef}%<> e like me <#a974ffff>pōʻino kilokilo<>. no hoʻouka <#a974ffff>{HitDmg}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>o ka mana mākau {HitCoef}%<> e like me hou hana pōʻino. (palena kiʻekiʻe {Max}manawa)",
        "ult": "ma kahi i koho ʻia <#ffb900ff>{Duration}kekona<> no. <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>ola kiʻekiʻe {HpRatio}%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>o ka mana mākau {Coef}%<> e like me <#a974ffff>pōʻino kilokilo<> <#ef5350ff>mākau <> kūlana."
